{
  "slug": "spm",
  "name": "Spm",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP server for the SPM skills registry. Search for AI agent skills by keyword, browse categories, get detailed skill info, and generate skill templates — all from within Claude Code.\nProvides 4 tools: spm_search, spm_info, spm_categories, and spm_template",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **3 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `skillpkg-usage`\n- **Commands** (3): `info` (Get detailed information about a specific SPM skill), `install` (Install an AI agent skill from the SPM registry), `search` (Search the SPM registry for AI agent skills)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `skillpkg`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install spm@claude-community` from `skillpkg/claude-plugin`.",
